# The CELLS SNAPSHOT — the canonical CAS toolchain cells, baked into the buck2
# binary and served as prelude//cells (Gate B of "buck2 just works": toolchains
# resolve with ZERO project configuration).
#
# The digests are the §6 REAPI roots of the producer's cells (straylight-
# toolchain cells/BUCK is the upstream source of truth; this file is the
# consumer-shipped snapshot of it). REFRESH mechanically, never by hand:
#
#   straylight cell gen --buck wasm-prelude/cell/cells/BUCK NAME=<built-tree> ...
#
# then rebuild buck2. A project can still shadow any of this: explicit
# `toolchain =` attrs and project-defined cells always win over these defaults.

